    "title": "Parents seek answers, reassurance as task force moves into the city - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By FOX13 Memphis News Staff ,\n1 hours ago MEMPHIS, Tenn. - Parents in Memphis said they want answers and reassurance as the Memphis Safe Task Force prepares to roll out into the city. An informational session hosted by the Memphis Lift gave families practical advice on what to do if they or their children encounter the National Guard on the streets. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
